{"id":"34b9d9e028267d9d","group":"90","path":"90/90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal.md","title":"Formal Diagonal Lemma","display":"thm-diagonal-lemma-formal — Formal Diagonal Lemma","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal","aliases":["90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal"],"display":"thm-diagonal-lemma-formal — Formal Diagonal Lemma","depends_on":["[[90-df-provable]]","[[90-df-diagonal-lemma]]","[[90-df-substitution-function]]","[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","[[90-df-numeral]]","[[90-df-formula]]","[[90-df-sentence]]","[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","[[90-df-syntax-interface]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-diagonal-lemma-formal — Formal Diagonal Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"00ee901093c12d44\" href=\"?note=00ee901093c12d44\" title=\"90-df-provable\">90-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f57084ad3c1a7029\" href=\"?note=f57084ad3c1a7029\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-lemma\">90-df-diagonal-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7279c20158ac140e\" href=\"?note=7279c20158ac140e\" title=\"90-df-substitution-function\">90-df-substitution-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d53b945955293235\" href=\"?note=d53b945955293235\" title=\"90-df-numeral\">90-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"714deb184f73887a\" href=\"?note=714deb184f73887a\" title=\"90-df-sentence\">90-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,g,d,T\">\\(S,g,d,T\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"f57084ad3c1a7029\" href=\"?note=f57084ad3c1a7029\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-lemma\">90-df-diagonal-lemma</a> 的同一算术编码环境；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}\">\\(\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>、数码与代入取所引文件。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\phi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\\ \\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\quad\nT\\vdash\\bigl(\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\phi[\\overline{g(\\psi)}/v]\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\phi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\\ \\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\quad\nT\\vdash\\bigl(\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\phi[\\overline{g(\\psi)}/v]\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>取强表示见证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vartheta(x,y,z)\">\\(\\vartheta(x,y,z)\\)</span>，并按固定新鲜变量算法重命名其束缚变量。对给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi(v)\">\\(\\phi(v)\\)</span>，选择不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi\">\\(\\phi\\)</span> 中出现的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\delta(v):=(v=v)\\land\\exists z\\bigl(\\vartheta(v,v,z)\\land\\phi[z/v]\\bigr),\\quad\nb:=g(\\delta),\\quad\\psi:=\\delta[\\bar b/v],\\quad c:=\\mathrm{Sub}_S(b,b)=g(\\psi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\delta(v):=(v=v)\\land\\exists z\\bigl(\\vartheta(v,v,z)\\land\\phi[z/v]\\bigr),\\quad\nb:=g(\\delta),\\quad\\psi:=\\delta[\\bar b/v],\\quad c:=\\mathrm{Sub}_S(b,b)=g(\\psi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>同一符号在不同位置的实例均采用无捕获同时代入。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span> 恰以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 为自由变量，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span> 是句子，替换编码等式适用。逐数表示给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\vartheta(\\bar b,\\bar b,\\bar c)\">\\(T\\vdash\\vartheta(\\bar b,\\bar b,\\bar c)\\)</span>；内部唯一性给出</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\forall z\\,(\\vartheta(\\bar b,\\bar b,z)\\leftrightarrow z=\\bar c).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T\\vdash\\forall z\\,(\\vartheta(\\bar b,\\bar b,z)\\leftrightarrow z=\\bar c).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>代入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span> 的展开式并用等号替换，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\phi[\\bar c/v]\">\\(T\\vdash\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\phi[\\bar c/v]\\)</span>。自反等式仅确保自由变量类型，不影响等价式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留同一固定点对象与充分条件；不另外假定有效公理化，也不把固定点等价误读为语法相等或标准模型真值相等。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"00ee901093c12d44","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"f57084ad3c1a7029","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-diagonal-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-substitution-function","status":"resolved","id":"7279c20158ac140e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-substitution-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b86b211a75cf1748","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"d53b945955293235","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b2789d377e1f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"714deb184f73887a","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-predicate-logic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d96c072a4c677f","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-syntax-interface","status":"resolved","id":"61d70aa13427c3b5","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-syntax-interface]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"f57084ad3c1a7029","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S,g,d,T$ 是 [[90-df-diagonal-lemma]] 的同一算术编码环境；$\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}$、$\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}$、$\\mathrm{Sent}_S$、数码与代入取所引文件。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,g,d,T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\phi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\\ \\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\quad\nT\\vdash\\bigl(\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\phi[\\overline{g(\\psi)}/v]\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\vartheta(x,y,z)","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi(v)","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta(v):=(v=v)\\land\\exists z\\bigl(\\vartheta(v,v,z)\\land\\phi[z/v]\\bigr),\\quad\nb:=g(\\delta),\\quad\\psi:=\\delta[\\bar b/v],\\quad c:=\\mathrm{Sub}_S(b,b)=g(\\psi).","display":true},{"tex":"\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash\\vartheta(\\bar b,\\bar b,\\bar c)","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash\\forall z\\,(\\vartheta(\\bar b,\\bar b,z)\\leftrightarrow z=\\bar c).","display":true},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\phi[\\bar c/v]","display":false}],"bytes":1922,"backlinks":[{"id":"5defe8d5249da268","anchor":"ref-20","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"这里把对角模式作为公理模式采用；[[90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal]] 则从替换函数的可表示性推出同一模式。"},{"id":"fca5455005daa120","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"对固定公式 $\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)$ 应用 [[90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal]]，得到 $H$ 的所需双条件，再展开 $\\mathrm{HenkinSent}_T$。"},{"id":"1c848f413742be8f","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"对固定公式 $\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)$ 应用 [[90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal]]，所得句子就是断言的 $G$；公式、编号和指定变量都使用本文件的共同环境。"},{"id":"23106efbc02dddf0","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"把给定 $\\varphi(v)$ 代入 [[90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal]]，再用 [[90-df-self-reference]] 的定义重写其双条件，即得结论。"},{"id":"7e636ff8dc7682de","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"反设存在满足 $\\mathrm{TruthDef}$ 的 $\\tau(v)$。对 $\\neg\\tau(v)$ 使用 [[90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal]]，取得句子 $\\psi$ 满足 $T\\vdash\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\tau[\\overline{g(\\psi)}/v]$。可靠性使该双条件在 $\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}$ 中为真；真值定义又使 $\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\models\\tau[\\overline{g(\\psi)}/v]$ 当且仅当 $\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\models\\psi$，二者矛盾。对角化充分性提供所需同一有效编码和句子，故满足真值定义的全部适用条件。"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-123","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-thm-diagonal-closure.md]]\n[[90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal.md]]\n[[90-thm-first-incompleteness.md]]\n[[90-thm-fixed-point-algorithm.md]]\n[[90-thm-kleene-second-recursion.md]]\n[[90-thm-min-closure-rec.md]]\n[[90-thm-myhill-operator.md]]\n[[90-thm-recursion-theorem.md]]\n[[90-thm-recursive-set-representation.md]]\n[[90-thm-second-incompleteness.md]]\n[[90-thm-smullyan-diagonal.md]]\n[[90-thm-tarski-undefinability.md]]"}],"outgoing":["00ee901093c12d44","f57084ad3c1a7029","7279c20158ac140e","b86b211a75cf1748","d53b945955293235","4ce2b2789d377e1f","714deb184f73887a","b7d96c072a4c677f","61d70aa13427c3b5"]}